            "review_title": "Review at Red&Round",
            "review_text": "johndoe\n6 contributions\n0\nExcellent fresh food - very authentic with Favorable Viet Flare\nOct 2024 • Business\nOct 12 2024. Red&Round in D7 was recommended by a local friend. (Italian food is never my first choice in HCMC, like P4P's). However, Red&Round was excellent. Best in City! Food as good as promo photos. Worth the time. Pizza - great crispy crust and fresh cheese; beef high quality and properly prepared; Salad fresh great dressing. Even the bread was toasted (with salad's avocado made adequate AvoToast) Truly as good as Italia or USA. Food as good as promotional photos - J\nRead more\nInsider tip:\nSlow and quiet at lunch. Know to be busy at diner. Order without question.\nValue\nService\nFood\nAtmosphere\nWritten October 12, 2024",
            "rating": 5.0,
            "review_date": "2026-10-14",
