            "review_text": "Craig UK\nHo Chi Minh City, Vietnam70 contributions\n0\nAmazing Italian food.\nJun 2024 • Family\nQuiet little restaurant with amazingly good fresh Italian food. Pizzas world class, pasta world class… it’s one of the best Italian restaurants in Ho Chi Minh City for authentic Italian food. \n\nI have been quite a few times now and the food has been fantastic each time. \n\nIt is quiet in the week so no need to book. Not sure about the weekend. \n\nThe owner is Italian with a passion from what I see.\n\nThere are about 8 different pasta choices, maybe 10 different pizzas and then some other mains.\nRead more\nWritten June 16, 2024",
