            "review_text": "RGSCEW\nAustralia535 contributions\n0\nGreat service, great food. Small venue but perfect experience.\nFeb 2021\nSix of us for dinner - place had been recommended by friends - and it didn't disappoint.\n\nWide selection of good Italian meals - entrees were good, pizza was good. I had spaghetti marinara which was delicious. \n\nService was excellent. Little glass of limoncello to finish the night... Enjoyed tat so much, we bought two bottles! \n\nVenue not large but beats other places hands down for service and quality.\nRead more\nWritten February 12, 2021",
