            "review_text": "schneider_27\nHo Chi Minh City, Vietnam45 contributions\n0\nOne of the best choice in D7\nJul 2020\nI came to this cozy little restaurant with my girlfriend for a lovely dinner and I must say we had a really nice time there.\n\nFirst they asked us if we wanted something to drink and when we heard \"spritz\" we had no doubt: we did well because it was really well done.\n\nThe menu is wide but above all it differs from the other restaurants in the area: there are so many interesting dishes that we didn't know what to choose.\n\nIn the end we ordered a carpaccio, a plate of mussels, a pizza with burrata to share and a tiramisu as dessert.\n\nAll was really good and abundant.\n\nThe staff with the right approach: kind and friendly but still very professional.\n\nI must confess that it was a really nice discovery and I think it's one of the best options to eat really well, feel full without spending too much that you can find in the D7.\n\nHighly recommended\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nReview collected in partnership with this restaurant \nWritten July 8, 2020",
